==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈbɹəʊkə/|a=RP}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-broker.wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈbɹoʊkɚ/|a=GenAm}}
